  Topic merchant_walk_c_r with merchant_c "Ask {merchant_c} how trade goes since the Walk came" when host(walk_c) >= 1 and stance(walk_c, s_resent) once {
    Says "'I am to be grateful,' says {merchant_c}. 'The priest has said so, and the bailiff. Everyone has a view and nobody has a loaf. I have sold out of everything I stock and the carter cannot get through for staves.' A dry laugh. 'If the Walk wants a miracle, I should be glad of a cart.'".
