  Topic inn_walk_c_p with innkeeper_c "Ask {innkeeper_c} how the inn has done since the Walk came" when host(walk_c) >= 1 and stance(walk_c, s_resent) once {
    Says "'Bread?' says {innkeeper_c}. 'My friend, I have never sold so much bread in a week. I laid in six sacks on the strength of a rumour and the rumour was kind. If the Walk walks to the Last Day I shall be a rich man and I shall be very sorry for the world.' A look of pure delight. 'You will have a loaf? On the house? No. Four crowns. But a warm one.'".
  }
  Topic inn_walk_c_r with innkeeper_c "Ask {innkeeper_c} how the inn has done since the Walk came" when host(walk_c) >= 1 and stance(walk_c, s_profit) once {
    Says "'Pilgrims in the yard,' says {innkeeper_c}, in the voice of a man to whom a thing has been done. 'Forty. On the straw. No beer, they say. No beer! And my regulars have gone to the ale-house in the next street, who have never forgiven me, and I do not suppose they will. There is a great deal of singing.' He wipes the bar. 'They are very clean. I will say that. It is the only thing I will say.'".
  }
