  }
  Topic inn_walk_d_p with innkeeper_d "Ask {innkeeper_d} how the inn has done since the Walk came" when host(walk_d) >= 1 and stance(walk_d, s_resent) once {
    Says "'It is a miracle,' says {innkeeper_d}, without irony, and counts coins into a jar. 'I do not say it is a holy one. I say that for the first time in my life the whole street comes in to buy rope.' He lowers his voice. 'I should like to know who is paying for the bread, because I think I should like to thank him. Or send him a bill.'".
  }
  Topic inn_walk_d_r with innkeeper_d "Ask {innkeeper_d} how the inn has done since the Walk came" when host(walk_d) >= 1 and stance(walk_d, s_profit) once {
    Says "'It is all very well,' says {innkeeper_d}, 'for those who sell chalk.' The bar gets a long wipe. 'They eat at my table and say a prayer to the road and leave a penny in the jar and it is the wrong sort of penny. I had a quiet house. I had a very quiet house, and I liked it.' He looks at the door. 'Do not let it get about that I said it.'".
  }
